    "commit": {
      "message": "Add Debug Workbench D4 browser bridge and Add Download debugger"
    },
    "notes": [
      "D4 extends Settings > Debug Workbench and does not add a top-level route, Room migration, network probe, custom-scheme opener, download enqueue, or upload path.",
      "Browser bridge debugger copies a redacted report and safe example test URIs for external verification only.",
      "Add Download debugger mirrors DownloadReviewPlanner for the active external draft and keeps the normal review-confirmation gate intact.",
      "Affected assertions were checked before packaging: D2/D3 debug contracts, D4 model tests, D4 contract tests, and the UixR6 normal UI release-seal source rule."
    ]
